statement='Private original-source occurrence authority survives actual selected scanner events, diagnostic copies, canonical copies and real splitter-frame synthetic events within one rewrite invocation, without public event fields or replacement behavior changes. Corrected original fixture fails seven of ten groups; final fixture passes all ten. Forty-two public before/after pairs preserve full AST/source/args/reference relationships/generated code/diagnostics/native/fresh values/errors/effects after only narrowly validated source-location and trace-clock normalization. Six unchanged suites pass144 groups per epoch. Eleven actual source inverses reach their named assertions and reject; eight input/channel/value/location/history controls reject. All5185 original regular Git inputs and81 prior guard inputs verify, with guard durability mode/revision-only qualification. Original authored cardinality error, standalone Core import RED/GREEN and incomplete first after capture remain exact and separate; fresh final capture governs acceptance.'
